00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.240
'cause I'm gonna tell
you something right now.

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:13.193
- Yeah.
- (clears throat) Funny.

00:03:14.241 --> 00:03:15.964
(Kelly and Terry laugh)

00:03:15.964 --> 00:03:16.797
- You're like,

00:03:16.797 --> 00:03:18.177
